<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine vegoil export prices July 17.</title>
<headline>Argentine vegoil export prices July 17.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRE 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine vegoil export offer/bid prices were as follows, traders said. (FOB in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>     Soy oil    Aug 523/517  Sep +160/+110</p>
<p>		    Oct/Nov/Dec +140/+100</p>
<p>     Sunoil     Aug 525/517 Sep 525/517</p>
<p>		    Mar/Apr 500/484</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
